    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "属性断言：Unstable systems like an inverted pendulum can be stabilized using feedback provided there is a sensor that measures the output quantity and a control input. For the inverted pendulum on a trolley, measuring the pendulum angle θ' and providing a control input u that accelerates the trolley can keep the pendulum upright.",
